| --- | --- | --- |
|  | P(R∣ηπ,μ)=∑hm∈ℋnP(hn∣π,μ)P(R∣hn,ρ).𝑃conditional𝑅subscript𝜂𝜋𝜇subscriptsubscriptℎ𝑚subscriptℋ𝑛𝑃conditionalsubscriptℎ𝑛𝜋𝜇𝑃conditional𝑅subscriptℎ𝑛𝜌\displaystyle P(R\mid\eta\_{\pi},\mu)=\sum\_{h\_{m}\in{\mathcal{H}}\_{n}}P(h\_{n}\mid\pi,\mu)P(R\mid h\_{n},{\rho}).italic\_P ( italic\_R ∣ italic\_η start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_π end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT , italic\_μ ) = ∑ start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_h start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_m end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT ∈ caligraphic\_H start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_n end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_P ( italic\_h start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_n end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT ∣ italic\_π , italic\_μ ) italic\_P ( italic\_R ∣ italic\_h start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_n end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT , italic\_ρ ) . |  |




