### 
6.4 The environments



The set ℳℳ{\mathcal{M}}caligraphic\_M has four deterministic environments: μBBsubscript𝜇𝐵𝐵\mu\_{BB}italic\_μ start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_B italic\_B end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT, where both parents will answer “banker”, μBDsubscript𝜇𝐵𝐷\mu\_{BD}italic\_μ start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_B italic\_D end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT where the mother will answer “banker” and the father “doctor”, μDBsubscript𝜇𝐷𝐵\mu\_{DB}italic\_μ start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_D italic\_B end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT, the opposite one, and μDDsubscript𝜇𝐷𝐷\mu\_{DD}italic\_μ start\_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic\_D italic\_D end\_POSTSUBSCRIPT, where they both answer “doctor”.




